UPDATE companies SET description='PB2 Foods, Inc. is headquartered in Tifton, Georgia. The company was launched in 2007 with a mission to help people find balance in everyday life through a line of plant-based products. While the founders are not named in public materials, the business began by developing a process that presses freshly roasted peanuts to remove most of the oil, creating a powdered peanut butter with significantly reduced fat and calories.

The company manufactures powdered nut butters, plant-based protein powders, pantry baking mixes, and a natural peanut butter spread. Its core process involves roasting U.S.-grown peanuts and pressing them to extract oil, then blending with ingredients such as sugar, salt, allulose, or palm oil depending on the product. Facility size, headcount, and production volumes are not disclosed.

PB2 products are sold directly to consumers through the company website and through major retailers nationwide and online marketplaces such as Amazon.

The company emphasizes that food can be both healthy and delicious, working closely with a network of family farmers to ensure consistent quality. Its differentiators include a clean-label approach, non-GMO ingredients, and products designed for versatile use in smoothies, baking, and spreads.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Peanut roasting", "Oil pressing/extraction", "Powdered nut butter manufacturing", "Plant-based protein powder manufacturing", "Baking mix production", "Peanut butter spread manufacturing"], "industries": ["Plant-based food products", "Retail", "E-commerce"], "materials": ["U.S.-grown peanuts", "Almonds", "Sugar", "Salt", "Allulose", "Palm oil", "Sea salt"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["90% less fat and 70% fewer calories than traditional peanut butter", "Made with U.S.-grown peanuts sourced from family farmers", "Non-GMO ingredients across the product line", "Plant-based, clean-label protein powders with zero added sugar", "No-stir natural peanut butter spread sweetened with allulose"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Tifton, Georgia -> db", "Founded in 2007 -> /about-us", "Mission to help find balance through plant-based products -> /about-us", "Core process: pressing roasted peanuts to remove oil -> /, /about-us", "Products: powdered nut butters, protein powders, baking mixes, peanut butter spread -> /", "Ingredients: roasted peanuts, almonds, sugar, salt, allulose, palm oil -> /", "U.S.-grown peanuts sourced from family farmers -> /, /about-us", "Non-GMO claim -> /", "Sales channels: direct website, major retailers, Amazon -> /", "Target customers: health-conscious, fitness enthusiasts, weight management -> /", "Clean label, zero added sugar for protein powders -> /", "No-stir natural peanut butter spread -> /", "Shipping within 1-2 business days -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "PB2 Powdered Peanut Butter is a low