UPDATE companies SET description='POLYWOOD was founded in 1990 in a garage in Indiana. The company is headquartered in Syracuse, Indiana, and operates manufacturing facilities in both Indiana and North Carolina.

The company manufactures outdoor furniture including Adirondack chairs, dining sets, deep seating, chaise lounges, rockers, and in-pool furniture. Finished pieces are shipped directly to consumers and commercial clients, with a white-glove delivery option that includes assembly and placement.

POLYWOOD serves residential customers through its direct-to-consumer website and showrooms, and supplies the commercial hospitality sector via a dedicated Commercial & Hospitality program. Its furniture is specified for hotels, resorts, restaurants, and public spaces.

The brand differentiates itself with a 20-year warranty, low-maintenance materials that resist splintering, rotting, cracking, and fading, and a commitment to U.S. manufacturing since its founding. The integrated UV inhibitors lock in color, while the Solidcore™ construction provides structural endurance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Outdoor furniture manufacturing", "Proprietary lumber extrusion (ClimateTuff\u2122, Solidcore\u2122)", "UV-inhibitor integration (ColorStay\u2122)", "Marine-grade stainless steel fastener installation with Xylan coating", "White-glove delivery and assembly", "Commercial & hospitality furnishing program", "Direct-to-consumer sales and showrooms"], "industries": ["Residential outdoor furniture", "Commercial hospitality", "Contract furniture"], "materials": ["Proprietary ClimateTuff\u2122 lumber", "Proprietary Solidcore\u2122 lumber", "Marine-grade stainless steel", "Xylan coating", "UV inhibitor compounds"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["20-year warranty on all lumber", "Proprietary ClimateTuff\u2122, Solidcore\u2122, and ColorStay\u2122 material technologies", "Marine-grade stainless steel fasteners with Xylan corrosion-resistant coating", "White-glove delivery with assembly and placement", "Made in the USA at facilities in Indiana and North Carolina"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1990 in Indiana garage -> db", "Headquarters Syracuse, Indiana -> db", "Facilities in Indiana and North Carolina -> db", "Manufactures outdoor furniture (Adirondack chairs, dining sets, etc.) -> page /", "Proprietary lumber: ClimateTuff\u2122, Solidcore\u2122, ColorStay\u2122 -> page /", "Marine-grade stainless steel fasteners with Xylan coating -> capabilities", "20-year warranty -> page /", "White-glove delivery with assembly -> page /", "Commercial & Hospitality program -> page /", "Made in USA since 1990 -> page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_