UPDATE companies SET description='The veteran-owned company began with a mission to serve others through dependable medical solutions, rooted in teamwork and respect.

The company operates as a durable medical equipment (DME) supplier, offering a broad range of products including enteral nutrition formulas and feeding tubes, urological catheters, incontinence supplies, pressure-relief support surfaces, ostomy and wound care products, tracheostomy supplies, mastectomy items, diabetic testing kits, and respiratory equipment. The team, led by COO Gray, Vice President of Sales Michael, and Billing Team Lead Missy, brings decades of combined healthcare experience to provide personalized product selection and ongoing support.

PRN serves clinics and healthcare providers, caregivers and patients, and referral partners across the Mid-Atlantic and Southern regions. Its programs supply hospitals, nursing homes, and home-based patients with enteral nutrition; provide catheter and incontinence products to long-term care facilities and individuals; and deliver support surfaces, wound care, and respiratory supplies to both clinical and home settings.

