UPDATE companies SET description='Paragon Electronic Systems, Inc. operates from Manchester, New Hampshire, where it was founded in 2006 by Jeff Routhier and Chris Pearson. The company began as a manufacturer''s representative firm focused on high-technology electronic components and system-level solutions for the New England market.

