UPDATE companies SET description='Parker Plastics Inc, headquartered in Pleasant Prairie, Wisconsin, was founded in 1989. The company operates four manufacturing facilities in Pleasant Prairie, Wisconsin; Sand Springs, Oklahoma; Hagerstown, Maryland; and North Las Vegas, Nevada.

