UPDATE companies SET description='PartWerx Automotive is headquartered in Garner, North Carolina, and was established in 2017 to address a gap in the market for a quality-focused distributor of aftermarket auto body parts that also delivered exceptional service in the Garner area. The company operates from 1035 N Greenfield Parkway and serves collision repair shops across a wide swath of central North Carolina.

