UPDATE companies SET description='Parts Direct Warehouse was founded in 2013 in Crystal Lake, Illinois, as a family-owned wholesale auto parts supplier targeting the northwest suburbs of Chicago. His partner, Mike, began his career delivering auto parts while in college, mastering pricing, inventory management, and operations. Together they launched Parts Direct to deliver high-quality components with the lowest warranty rates in the market.

