UPDATE companies SET description='Paxs Foods, doing business as Paxs Distributors, is headquartered in Gardena, California. The company operates a food distribution and processing business focused on serving Japanese markets across the United States.

The company provides a range of services including food distribution, food processing, international import, storage, and transportation. It owns a fleet of refrigerated trucks and vans capable of handling dry, chilled, and frozen products. Paxs Foods emphasizes a complete in-house operation that covers purchasing, inspection, sorting, and shipping. The company also produces its own line of original food products, such as bento boxes, sushi rice, and noodles.

Paxs Foods primarily serves Japanese grocery markets in Los Angeles and San Diego, delivering directly via its own fleet. It also ships products to customers on the West Coast, East Coast, and in Hawaii through third-party freight carriers.

