UPDATE companies SET description='Phoenix Hardwood & Plywood operates from Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, and has been supplying hardwood products since 2000. The company functions as a wholesale distributor serving the state of Oklahoma from its facility on North Classen Boulevard.

