UPDATE companies SET description='Plaice Cove Electronics LLC operates from North Hampton, New Hampshire, where it functions as a hybrid distributor of electronic components and hardware. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, but it presents itself as a complete solutions provider for the electronics manufacturing industry.

