UPDATE companies SET description='Plastic Design International (PDI Molding) operates from Middletown, Connecticut, where it was founded in 1977 as a short-run prototype R&D business. The company has since evolved into a full-service injection molding resource center with two facilities totaling 55,000 square feet.

